e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82f8e7c92cfb99ea\" href=\"?note=82f8e7c92cfb99ea\" title=\"17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism\">17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"5.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local complete-theory consequence of Theorem 5.1.13"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>298</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement compared in supplied OCR; completeness supplies elementary equivalence"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.3.3"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\)</span> (complete-theory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (cardinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\n=\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|\n=\n\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak B)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\n=\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|\n=\n\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak B)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Completeness makes the two models elementarily equivalent; <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"82f8e7c92cfb99ea\" href=\"?note=82f8e7c92cfb99ea\" title=\"17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism\">17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism</a> then supplies the transfinite back-and-forth isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","ancho